# GSO shapes: SHACL for story knowledge graphs
#
# GENERATED from data/story/ by the engine (engine/story/StoryOntology.cpp).
# Don't edit: change the JSON files and regenerate (ontology/README.md).

@prefix gso:     <https://w3id.org/aige/gso#> .
@prefix gsv:     <https://w3id.org/aige/gso/vocab#> .
